1. DEFINITIONS

   "Software" means the Contextify proxy, its command-line tools, its
   configuration and setup programs, its hosted components, and any object,
   bundled, minified, or compiled form of any of them.

   "You" means the individual or entity that installs or uses the Software.

   "Credit" means prepaid entitlement to Optimisation, purchased from
   Contextify or granted by Contextify without charge.

   "Optimisation" means the Software's caching, request coalescing, cache
   breakpoint injection, deduplication, and related functions that reduce the
   fees You would otherwise pay to a model provider.

   "Free Allowance" means the first fifteen United States dollars (US$15.00)
   of measured savings, granted once per account.

2. GRANT

   Subject to this agreement, Contextify grants You a limited, revocable,
   non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable licence to install and
   run the Software for Your own internal purposes, for so long as You hold
   Free Allowance or Credit, or an active subscription.

   No other rights are granted. Rights not expressly granted are reserved.

3. RESTRICTIONS

   You may not:

   (a) copy, publish, distribute, sell, rent, lease, sublicense, or otherwise
