   (e) remove, obscure, or alter any copyright, trademark, or licence notice;

   (f) use the Software to build or assist in building a competing product.

4. CREDIT AND FEES

   (a) The Free Allowance is granted once per account and is not renewable.

   (b) Beyond the Free Allowance, Optimisation requires Credit. Credit is
       prepaid, is denominated in measured savings, and is consumed as savings
       are delivered.

   (c) Savings are measured from the model provider's own reported usage
       figures. The measurement method is described in the product
       documentation, and Your statement itemises it.

   (d) Credit is non-refundable except where required by law, and expires
       twenty-four (24) months after purchase.

   (e) Prices may change on thirty (30) days' notice. Credit already purchased
       is honoured at the rate at which it was bought.

5. MEASUREMENT AND ACTIVATION

   (a) The Software reports measured savings, a licence identifier, and an
       anonymous instance identifier to Contextify in order to account for
       Credit. It does not transmit prompts, completions, API credentials,
       hostnames, or network addresses.

   (b) You consent to that reporting for the term of this agreement. It is
       necessary for Credit accounting and cannot be disabled while Credit is
       in use.

   (c) You may not interfere with, spoof, replay, or block that reporting.

6. WHAT HAPPENS WHEN CREDIT RUNS OUT

   When Free Allowance and Credit are exhausted, the Software STOPS
   OPTIMISING AND CONTINUES TO OPERATE AS A TRANSPARENT PASS-THROUGH. Your
   requests keep reaching Your model provider. Nothing you have deployed
   stops working; it simply stops saving You money until Credit is added.

   Contextify does not assert, and expressly disclaims, any right to interrupt
   the operation of Your systems.

